{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:03 2026-10-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:03 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:03 2026-10-30 HKT</p><img alt=\"何文田12歲松鼠狗疑受虐至眼傷 警拘44歲印傭\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/818ce3848722463c55053d82a79bd719/2026-10/police_KLcity_1.jpg\"/><p>何文田窩打老道112號今日（10月30日）上午有住戶報案，表示其飼養的12歲松鼠狗，懷疑被家傭不恰當對待。警員接報到場初步調查，發現松鼠狗左眼受傷，遂以涉嫌「殘酷對待動物」拘捕扣查涉案44歲印尼裔女傭。目前案件交由九龍城警區刑事支援隊跟進。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:23:54.965542+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T09:03:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:23:36.753230+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:19:28.347451+00:00","content_hash":"ea6411003c5270931020f78f3e158883a8817cd73747c83a1b73eafc68fdcf3f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}